s\"><strong>Jules</strong></a></td><td>Richard's son, dreams of being an expeditioner</td><td>Lumière</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/Lucie\"><strong>Lucie</strong></a></td><td>Ex-expeditioner, replaced by Seba</td><td>Lumière</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Renoir</strong></td><td>Primary antagonist, driven to save his family</td><td>Various</td></tr><tr><td><strong><a href=\"/characters\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Esquie</a></strong></td><td>Mythical mount (swim, dive, fly)</td><td>Unlocked through story</td></tr></tbody></table>"
