      "title": "Mounts & Companions",
      "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center;margin:16px 0\"><img src=\"/images/characters/esquie.png\" alt=\"Esquie\" style=\"width:200px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #2a2a35\" /><p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#9898a8;margin-top:4px\"><a href=\"/characters\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\">Esquie</a> — your mythical mount</p></div><p><strong>Esquie</strong> is your mythical mount companion that gains new traversal abilities throughout the game:</p><ul><li><strong>Swim</strong> — Cross bodies of water</li><li><strong>Dive</strong> — Access underwater areas</li><li><strong>Climb</strong> — Reach elevated platforms</li><li><strong>Fly</strong> — Unlocked late-game, access all areas</li></ul><p>Collect Esquie's missing rocks scattered across the world to unlock new abilities. After collecting 5 Gestrals, you unlock the ability to break Paint Spikes.</p>"
